00:09:25.233 --> 00:09:26.467
You can see me?

00:09:26.467 --> 00:09:27.500
-I'm just gonna watch Corpse
for a little bit.

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:28.700
I want to see what he does.

00:09:28.700 --> 00:09:31.233
-Hey, Jimmy, I can't find you.
Oh, Jimmy's dead.

00:09:31.233 --> 00:09:33.633
-Gaten, is it you?

00:09:33.633 --> 00:09:35.967
-Oh, my Corpse!
My soap boxes!

00:09:35.967 --> 00:09:37.700
Aah!

00:09:37.700 --> 00:09:39.467
[ All talking at once ]

00:09:39.467 --> 00:09:40.867
-Now I can see you, Jimmy.

00:09:40.867 --> 00:09:45.067
[ All talking at once ]

00:09:45.067 --> 00:09:46.700
-It was in --
It was in storage.

00:09:46.700 --> 00:09:49.700
-He was just alive.
-Wait, it was in storage?

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:51.033
-Storage?
-Wow.

00:09:51.033 --> 00:09:54.300
I'm watching everyone act,
and it is unbelievable.

00:09:54.300 --> 00:09:56.500
Someone in here
that is a great actor.

00:09:56.500 --> 00:09:59.633
Tariq, it's not you.
-[ Laughs ]

00:09:59.633 --> 00:10:02.100
-No, it's def-- It's not me.
It's not me.

00:10:02.100 --> 00:10:05.233
-It's not you, but someone
is acting so well right now.

00:10:05.233 --> 00:10:06.967
-It's Kirk.
It's Kirk.

00:10:06.967 --> 00:10:09.767
-I know who it is,
and it's unbelievable.

00:10:09.767 --> 00:10:11.800
-It's definitely Gaten.
-We have to snitch.

00:10:11.800 --> 00:10:14.067
-I don't think none of The Roots
are acting.

00:10:14.067 --> 00:10:16.633
-Okay, wait, no.
Didn't you call the meeting?

00:10:16.633 --> 00:10:19.267
-I can't even try to act.
I've been dead the whole time.

00:10:19.267 --> 00:10:21.867
-I reported Corpse's body
in the storage room.

00:10:21.867 --> 00:10:23.933
And I came back from --
From there...

00:10:23.933 --> 00:10:25.300
-I want to look at comments.

00:10:25.300 --> 00:10:26.567
-He was in navigation with me.

00:10:26.567 --> 00:10:28.833
-There's comments?
I want to see them.

00:10:28.833 --> 00:10:30.867
-I'm seeing a lot
of Bob Ross heads.

00:10:30.867 --> 00:10:33.400
-Chats and e-mail only
right now.

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:35.333
-How do you go to the chat?

00:10:35.333 --> 00:10:37.500
-I'm looking at the chat, dude,
and it is --

00:10:37.500 --> 00:10:39.433
-I don't think
it's yellow, green, red.

00:10:39.433 --> 00:10:41.700
-Is it?

00:10:41.700 --> 00:10:43.633
-I see a lot of heads.

00:10:43.633 --> 00:10:44.767
-It's on me.

00:10:44.767 --> 00:10:45.767
-Oh, okay.

00:10:45.767 --> 00:10:48.100
-We're getting no information.

00:10:48.100 --> 00:10:51.333
Victoria, who is it?

00:10:51.333 --> 00:10:52.867
-I don't know.

00:10:52.867 --> 00:10:55.767
-Why is the chat just emojis?

00:10:55.767 --> 00:10:57.633
-It's because
they're in emote-only mode.

00:10:57.633 --> 00:10:58.800
-Corpse, I can't believe

00:10:58.800 --> 00:11:00.733
I'm the one that got you killed
basically.

00:11:00.733 --> 00:11:02.533
-Wait, Corpse is dead?

00:11:02.533 --> 00:11:04.433
-Why don't you let them
say words?

00:11:04.433 --> 00:11:05.800
-They're not paying attention
to this game.

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:07.033
-She was trying to be cool.

00:11:07.033 --> 00:11:08.633
-Corpse, you can't talk in
that voice no more, man.

00:11:08.633 --> 00:11:09.900
You're dead.

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:11.367
-[ Deep voice ] I'm sorry.
I'll use the other voice.

00:11:11.367 --> 00:11:12.733
-Oh, my God.

00:11:12.733 --> 00:11:15.933
-Once he dies, he's like,
[high voice] "Hi, guys."

00:11:15.933 --> 00:11:19.067
-[ As Bullwinkle ] Hey, Rocky!

00:11:19.067 --> 00:11:20.400
-I'm voting Kirk, too.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.700
-You think it's Kirk?

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:23.633
-Kirk. It's Kirk.
-You voted Kirk.

00:11:23.633 --> 00:11:26.233
-I don't know.
-It has to be Kirk.

00:11:26.233 --> 00:11:27.700
-Oh, geez.
-Got to be.

00:11:27.700 --> 00:11:28.733
-This is unbelievable.

00:11:28.733 --> 00:11:30.533
What I'm seeing here
is unbelievable.

00:11:30.533 --> 00:11:32.500
This is probably one of
the best games ever played.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:33.967
-No!

00:11:33.967 --> 00:11:36.067
-Yes, that's right!

00:11:36.067 --> 00:11:37.633
-I'm not that good an actor.
-Sorry, Kirk.

00:11:37.633 --> 00:11:40.833
-Wait, wait.
-Wait. I'm still playing?

00:11:40.833 --> 00:11:42.400
-I'll be honest.
I just gave in to pressure.

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:43.600
Everyone said Kirk.

00:11:43.600 --> 00:11:46.467
-Tell me what to do.
Like somebody.

00:11:46.467 --> 00:11:49.567
-You go to the task, Quest,
and you press "A."

00:11:49.567 --> 00:11:50.700
-I'm trying to eat this pizza.

00:11:50.700 --> 00:11:53.167
-Remember, you're supposed
to do your task.

00:11:53.167 --> 00:11:54.500
[ All talking at once ]

00:11:54.500 --> 00:11:56.633
-I don't think
that's part of the task.

00:11:56.633 --> 00:12:01.000
-You're not -- you're not
gonna do anything here, right?

00:12:01.000 --> 00:12:03.433
-You're separate.
-We're a group now.

00:12:03.433 --> 00:12:04.767
-What?
-I don't even know what to do.

00:12:04.767 --> 00:12:05.933
-Splitting up -- that's what

00:12:05.933 --> 00:12:07.700
you're not supposed to do in
horror movies.

00:12:07.700 --> 00:12:08.867
-No, we got to split up

00:12:08.867 --> 00:12:10.767
so the killer
has a chance to kill us.

00:12:10.767 --> 00:12:12.467
-Okay, yeah. Let's all...

00:12:12.467 --> 00:12:14.567
Who's following me?
Questlove keeps following me.

00:12:14.567 --> 00:12:16.633
-Weird.
-I'm not following you.

00:12:16.633 --> 00:12:19.600
[ All talking at once ]

00:12:19.600 --> 00:12:21.800
-I'm in outer space right now.

00:12:21.800 --> 00:12:24.000
-Oh, my gosh.
-Come back.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:26.700
-Oh, my gosh.
Oh, my gosh.

00:12:26.700 --> 00:12:28.000
-Oh, my gosh.

00:12:28.000 --> 00:12:30.567
-Jimmy, where are you?
We can finally be together.

00:12:30.567 --> 00:12:33.433
-Wait, wait.

00:12:33.433 --> 00:12:35.833
That makes me want to call
an emergency meeting right now.

00:12:35.833 --> 00:12:38.300
-I'm calling HR
on the Corpse.

00:12:38.300 --> 00:12:39.500
-What?
-What?

00:12:39.500 --> 00:12:42.233
-You're scaring me.
-He wants to hang, man.

00:12:42.233 --> 00:12:43.967
Wait. There's gonna be
a meltdown real soon.

00:12:43.967 --> 00:12:45.433
-In an hour.

00:12:45.433 --> 00:12:47.267
-They got it?

00:12:47.267 --> 00:12:48.200
-Guys, I have an idea.

00:12:48.200 --> 00:12:49.433
What if when you die,
you mute?

00:12:49.433 --> 00:12:52.367
-I was in the room
with Valkyr-- with Rae and.

00:12:52.367 --> 00:12:53.667
-Yeah, yeah.

00:12:53.667 --> 00:12:55.067
-...and Victoria
and Sykkuno was there,

00:12:55.067 --> 00:12:57.433
but Tariq wasn't there.
-Mm.

00:12:57.433 --> 00:12:59.333
-So now we're back in?

00:12:59.333 --> 00:13:00.567
-Dig that.
-No, no, no.

00:13:00.567 --> 00:13:02.733
-Corpse, here we are together,
dude. And Quest.

00:13:02.733 --> 00:13:04.333
-Should I use it?
-We're three ghosts.

00:13:04.333 --> 00:13:05.500
-I'm gonna use it.
-Do it.

00:13:05.500 --> 00:13:07.167
-Oh. Oh.
-Uh...

00:13:07.167 --> 00:13:11.033
-I call this emergency
meeting for the purpose

00:13:11.033 --> 00:13:14.200
of I'm making an accusation.

00:13:14.200 --> 00:13:17.067
The rest of us already
was in one little section,

00:13:17.067 --> 00:13:21.133
Tariq was not.
and the stuff was sabotaged.

00:13:21.133 --> 00:13:22.300
So...

00:13:22.300 --> 00:13:23.667
-You know what?
That's good enough for me.

00:13:23.667 --> 00:13:25.000
I believe you.
-Good enough for me.

00:13:25.000 --> 00:13:27.500
-You caught him.

00:13:27.500 --> 00:13:29.000
-Can the imposter be dead?

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:32.000
-You are.
-Who?

00:13:32.000 --> 00:13:35.867
-Oh, I thought Questlove said --
Yeah, the imposter can be dead.

00:13:35.867 --> 00:13:37.867
-He's been dead.
-He's been dead.

00:13:37.867 --> 00:13:40.100
-Why am I still playing
if I'm dead?

00:13:40.100 --> 00:13:42.167
-What?
-[ Gasps ]

00:13:42.167 --> 00:13:45.267
-That's not how you lose.

00:13:45.267 --> 00:13:46.733
-Wait, that's...

00:13:46.733 --> 00:13:49.500
[ All talking at once ]

00:13:49.500 --> 00:13:50.733
-It's Victoria, isn't it?

00:13:50.733 --> 00:13:51.700
-No!
-I'm now a ghost.

00:13:51.700 --> 00:13:53.300
-It's Victoria.
It's so Victoria.

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:54.867
-It's Victoria.
-It's Victoria.

00:13:54.867 --> 00:13:55.967
-Wait, can you call --

00:13:55.967 --> 00:13:57.067
Wait, can you sabotage

00:13:57.067 --> 00:13:58.933
while you're in the room
with people?

00:13:58.933 --> 00:14:00.367
-Yeah.
-Sorry?

00:14:00.367 --> 00:14:03.100
-Then that was a completely
illegitimate accusation.

00:14:03.100 --> 00:14:05.500
-Okay, I didn't hear
what you said.

00:14:05.500 --> 00:14:06.900
-Sorry.

00:14:06.900 --> 00:14:10.967
I'm calling Orson.

00:14:10.967 --> 00:14:14.000
-That was a good
Norm Macdonald impression.

00:14:14.000 --> 00:14:16.000
[ Laughs ]

00:14:16.000 --> 00:14:18.200
-Right. It's got to be Victoria.
Right?

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:19.267
-Can we just vote?

00:14:19.267 --> 00:14:21.467
-No! Why?!

00:14:21.467 --> 00:14:22.600
-Where do all the ghosts --

00:14:22.600 --> 00:14:24.300
Where do all the cool ghosts
hang out?

00:14:24.300 --> 00:14:27.033
-Wait. So, yeah.
-Let's just do it.

00:14:27.033 --> 00:14:29.267
-Let's just do it.
-Emergency meeting?

00:14:29.267 --> 00:14:30.400
-No.
-Yeah. We're just --

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:32.500
-Wait, wait, wait.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:34.433
-Any last words, Victoria?

00:14:34.433 --> 00:14:35.900
-Are we going Victoria?

00:14:35.900 --> 00:14:37.467
-Fine, I was gonna try
and kill one of you

00:14:37.467 --> 00:14:38.933
before you called
an emergency meeting.

00:14:38.933 --> 00:14:41.667
-You think it's Victoria?
-Wow.

00:14:41.667 --> 00:14:42.933
-It was a confession.

00:14:42.933 --> 00:14:46.433
[ All talking at once ]

00:14:46.433 --> 00:14:48.333
I just couldn't do it anymore.

00:14:48.333 --> 00:14:50.700
-Your acting is so good,
Victoria. It's insane.

00:14:50.700 --> 00:14:53.200
-Oh, I'm so anxious.
-Dude.

00:14:53.200 --> 00:14:55.400
-You didn't kill Jimmy first,
did you?

00:14:55.400 --> 00:14:57.100
-Trying to be fun and...

00:14:57.100 --> 00:14:58.967
-Yeah, who killed Jimmy first?

00:14:58.967 --> 00:15:01.433
-I didn't kill anyone.
-Wait. Really?

00:15:01.433 --> 00:15:04.300
-Oh, my gosh.

00:15:04.300 --> 00:15:05.867
-That was unbelievable.
That was so --

00:15:05.867 --> 00:15:07.433
-That was an experience.
-Oh, my gosh.

00:15:07.433 --> 00:15:10.167
I'm sorry, Jimmy.
I'm sorry, Jimmy.

00:15:10.167 --> 00:15:11.800
You were right there.

00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:13.000
-I don't know what I'm doing!

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:14.467
-I was messing with you
and you're like --

00:15:14.467 --> 00:15:16.033
-I do not know what I'm doing.

00:15:16.033 --> 00:15:17.700
-No, I liked it.
I liked it.

00:15:17.700 --> 00:15:20.467
-I'm being trolled right now.

00:15:20.467 --> 00:15:22.467
-I'm sorry, Jimmy.

00:15:22.467 --> 00:15:27.533
You were just -- you were
just there and ready to die.

00:15:27.533 --> 00:15:28.733
-Yes.
-I agree.

00:15:28.733 --> 00:15:30.567
-Hey, I have an idea.
-I saw the chat.

00:15:30.567 --> 00:15:33.867
-Teach us how to play the game.

00:15:33.867 --> 00:15:35.100
-Wait, where is everyone?

00:15:35.100 --> 00:15:36.667
-Noah, what are you saying?
-What, Noah?

00:15:36.667 --> 00:15:38.500
-I saw in the chat, a lot
of people saying,

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:39.967
"When you die,
you should mute."

00:15:39.967 --> 00:15:41.633
-Yeah, I agree.
-Yeah.

00:15:41.633 --> 00:15:45.033
It all depends if we want
to continue talking and whatnot.

00:15:45.033 --> 00:15:47.100
-I think that was like
a warm-up round anyways.

00:15:47.100 --> 00:15:48.367
-Yeah.

00:15:48.367 --> 00:15:50.167
-Also, I guess it's not great
for television.

00:15:50.167 --> 00:15:52.033
I mean...
-That's true. Yeah.

00:15:52.033 --> 00:15:54.533
So you're trying to go
for television.

00:15:54.533 --> 00:15:56.200
-I'm the host of the show.

00:15:56.200 --> 00:15:57.400
Hey, I'm just gonna mute myself.

00:15:57.400 --> 00:15:59.700
-Yeah, we killed the host
of the show first?

00:15:59.700 --> 00:16:02.000
-You're the host.
-We killed the host.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:03.467
-I killed the host first.

00:16:03.467 --> 00:16:05.500
-I was coming --
Victoria, is that what I was --

00:16:05.500 --> 00:16:09.367
-I think we can agree, though,
like if you die, you can just,

00:16:09.367 --> 00:16:12.100
like, keep it down.
-Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:16:12.100 --> 00:16:14.267
-Shut up.
-I'll keep it down.

00:16:14.267 --> 00:16:16.400
-Start with Corpse.

00:16:16.400 --> 00:16:18.333
-I'd just like to know
how I went wrong.

00:16:18.333 --> 00:16:20.000
-Is someone not updated?

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:22.567
-Should we go Skeld
or Airship?

00:16:22.567 --> 00:16:24.133
-We're going to do Airship.

00:16:24.133 --> 00:16:26.833
I don't think
we can actually change.

00:16:26.833 --> 00:16:29.433
-Alright, should we play again?

00:16:29.433 --> 00:16:30.700
-I think so.
-Yes.

00:16:30.700 --> 00:16:33.433
-Yeah.
-Wait. Is everybody here?

00:16:33.433 --> 00:16:35.100
-Yes, I am.
-Ready?

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:36.300
-Well...
-Yeah.

00:16:36.300 --> 00:16:38.467
-One more.
-One more. Alright, thank you.

00:16:38.467 --> 00:16:39.867
-We are missing...
-Who's not here?

00:16:39.867 --> 00:16:42.000
-Corpse, we're
in this together, bud.

00:16:42.000 --> 00:16:45.033
-Noah's here.
-Yes. Absolutely, Jimmy.

00:16:45.033 --> 00:16:46.533
-Who are we missing?

00:16:46.533 --> 00:16:48.133
-Yeah, if we want
to switch maps,

00:16:48.133 --> 00:16:50.300
we'll probably have
to switch out.

00:16:50.300 --> 00:16:51.833
-Quest?
-I'm right here.

00:16:51.833 --> 00:16:53.100
-Someone's not updated.

00:16:53.100 --> 00:16:55.133
-There he is.
-Tariq!

00:16:55.133 --> 00:16:57.133
-Hey.
-All in?

00:16:57.133 --> 00:16:59.433
-Yeah.
-Here we go.

00:16:59.433 --> 00:17:00.800
-Wait, we're doing it --
we're doing it now?

00:17:00.800 --> 00:17:02.067
-Yeah.
-Oh, okay.

00:17:02.067 --> 00:17:03.100
We'll do the Skeld again.
Why not?

00:17:03.100 --> 00:17:05.767
Do the Airship after.
-Skeld.

00:17:05.767 --> 00:17:09.033
-Alright. So this is Skeld.
This is...

00:17:09.033 --> 00:17:10.033
-The same map.

00:17:10.033 --> 00:17:11.267
-Same map.
Same map. Gotcha.

00:17:11.267 --> 00:17:12.667
Oh, gosh,
you get to change the map.

00:17:12.667 --> 00:17:14.033
This is insane.

00:17:14.033 --> 00:17:15.833
Alright.
I'm gonna play much better.

00:17:15.833 --> 00:17:17.867
-Oh, you're gonna --
There's gonna be a time

00:17:17.867 --> 00:17:19.133
when we switch.

00:17:19.133 --> 00:17:20.533
-Don't worry, Jimmy.

00:17:20.533 --> 00:17:22.900
-Don't worry, Jimmy.
We got you.

00:17:22.900 --> 00:17:24.467
-These guys bothering you,
Jimmy?

00:17:24.467 --> 00:17:25.967
-Yeah.
-Why did you stand on a vent?

00:17:25.967 --> 00:17:28.667
Why did you stand on a vent?
-I didn't stand on a vent.

00:17:28.667 --> 00:17:31.767
Stop following me, man.
-Why -- why are --

00:17:31.767 --> 00:17:33.200
-Get away from me.
Everybody get away from me.

00:17:33.200 --> 00:17:34.733
What's going on?!
Let me be!

00:17:34.733 --> 00:17:37.233
Oh, my God! No!
-Okay.

00:17:37.233 --> 00:17:40.000
-No! No!
Oh, my gosh.

00:17:40.000 --> 00:17:42.000
Don't kill me, please.

00:17:42.000 --> 00:17:43.300
Please!

00:17:43.300 --> 00:17:44.367
-Jimmy's the imposter.

00:17:44.367 --> 00:17:45.733
-I think Jimmy's real nervous.

00:17:45.733 --> 00:17:47.567
-Jimmy's definitely
the imposter.

00:17:47.567 --> 00:17:49.733
-Let me play! Please! No!
-He's giving it away.

00:17:49.733 --> 00:17:51.133
-I'm not giving anything away.

00:17:51.133 --> 00:17:52.933
Kirk, why are you not moving
at all?

00:17:52.933 --> 00:17:54.333
-I'm moving, I'm moving,
I'm moving.

00:17:54.333 --> 00:17:55.933
-Stop following me.
Everyone, stop it.

00:17:55.933 --> 00:17:57.100
-That's your name, Jimmy.

00:17:57.100 --> 00:17:58.667
-We just want to make sure
you don't die.

00:17:58.667 --> 00:18:01.200
-No problem.
Good task, everybody.

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:03.333
-You're all making Jimmy
super nervous.

00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:06.167
[ All talking at once ]

00:18:06.167 --> 00:18:08.633
-What task is that one?
-What are you doing?

00:18:08.633 --> 00:18:10.700
-Corpse, don't say,
"What are you doing"?

00:18:10.700 --> 00:18:12.000
What does that mean?

00:18:12.000 --> 00:18:13.167
-Corpse, let's --

00:18:13.167 --> 00:18:15.167
-Watch this.
Watch out!

00:18:17.267 --> 00:18:19.800
-Oh, no!
-Who's dead.

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:20.867
-Someone killed Rae.

00:18:20.867 --> 00:18:22.533
-[ Gasps ]
Someone killed Rae.

00:18:22.533 --> 00:18:23.967
-Not Rae.
-Rae?

00:18:23.967 --> 00:18:25.200
