00:29:11.600 --> 00:29:12.667
-Alright, let's go.
Let's go.

00:29:12.667 --> 00:29:14.667
-Let's do it.
-This is a different map.

00:29:14.667 --> 00:29:15.600
This map is way bigger.

00:29:15.600 --> 00:29:16.700
-Yeah, this is a bigger map.

00:29:16.700 --> 00:29:17.800
-Oh, no.

00:29:17.800 --> 00:29:19.633
-There's gonna be
a little bit more chaos.

00:29:19.633 --> 00:29:21.467
-And new tasks.
-And new tasks.

00:29:21.467 --> 00:29:23.133
-Come on, shush.
Tell me what's up.

00:29:23.133 --> 00:29:24.967
Give me the shush.

00:29:24.967 --> 00:29:26.933
