00:34:45.900 --> 00:34:47.533
-Oh, report, report.
Oh, my God.

00:34:47.533 --> 00:34:49.933
-Oh, man.
I was with Corpse.

00:34:49.933 --> 00:34:51.433
I was with Corpse.

00:34:51.433 --> 00:34:53.800
I don't know.
-I thought it was Rae.

00:34:53.800 --> 00:34:57.133
-I'm just saying --
-I also thought it was Rae.

00:34:57.133 --> 00:34:59.100
-Yeah.
-I had such a strong feeling.

00:34:59.100 --> 00:35:03.900
