00:35:23.567 --> 00:35:26.200
-Oh.
-Hmm.

00:35:26.200 --> 00:35:28.767
-Jimmy, tell us who killed you.

00:35:28.767 --> 00:35:31.267
-Oh, wow.
-Voting for me.

00:35:31.267 --> 00:35:33.033
-Look at that.
It's a tie.

00:35:33.033 --> 00:35:34.533
-Gaten, why are you
voting for me?

00:35:34.533 --> 00:35:36.767
