Questlove. Did not kill anyone.

00:35:43.500 --> 00:35:45.133
Did not slash anyone.

00:35:45.133 --> 00:35:50.167
[ All talking at once ]

00:35:50.167 --> 00:35:52.467
-Gaten, where are you?
-I'm right here.

00:35:52.467 --> 00:35:54.900
-Oh, God, Victoria.
-Sykkuno, where we off to?

00:35:54.900 --> 00:35:56.867
Sykkuno, you know
who did it, right?

00:35:56.867 --> 00:35:59.067
