Oh, my God, it's Sykkuno!
-No.

00:46:11.700 --> 00:46:13.500
-No, it's not me.
It's not me.

00:46:13.500 --> 00:46:16.867
-No, no, no, no!
No, no, no, no!

00:46:16.867 --> 00:46:18.467
-If it was me --
-Chill out.

00:46:18.467 --> 00:46:19.633
-A dead body.

00:46:19.633 --> 00:46:20.833
-It's Kirk.

00:46:20.833 --> 00:46:22.500
No, it's not Kirk.

00:46:22.500 --> 00:46:25.067
-Kirk's dead.
Kirk's dead.

00:46:25.067 --> 00:46:27.633
-Valkyrae's the murderer.
-They killed him.

00:46:27.633 --> 00:46:28.767
-What do you mean?

00:46:28.767 --> 00:46:30.200
-It's not. It's not Rae.

00:46:30.200 --> 00:46:31.967
-It's not me.

00:46:31.967 --> 00:46:35.000
-Collectively.
Rae is the murderer.

00:46:35.000 --> 00:46:37.900
-Oh, I think I know who it is.

00:46:37.900 --> 00:46:40.233
-It's not me.
I reported the first body.

00:46:40.233 --> 00:46:41.400
-I know who it is.
Oh, no.

00:46:41.400 --> 00:46:42.833
-Wait, Corpse,
why did you call it?

00:46:42.833 --> 00:46:45.200
-I found a body.
I didn't call it.

00:46:45.200 --> 00:46:46.833
-Oh, what?

00:46:46.833 --> 00:46:49.033
-Yeah. No.
Who was behind you?

00:46:49.033 --> 00:46:50.767
-It was Kirk, right?
-Yeah.

00:46:50.767 --> 00:46:52.700
-I'm gonna say it's Victoria,

00:46:52.700 --> 00:46:56.467
despite seeing
her other acting moves.

00:46:56.467 --> 00:46:57.800
-I trust Jimmy.

00:46:57.800 --> 00:46:59.133
I was with him, like,
the whole time.

00:46:59.133 --> 00:47:00.433
-No, no, he's completely
innocent.

00:47:00.433 --> 00:47:02.600
-I think Victoria.
I think Sykkuno.

00:47:02.600 --> 00:47:03.833
-Rae's the murderer.

00:47:03.833 --> 00:47:05.433
-Wait, wait, I was with Jimmy
the whole time.

00:47:05.433 --> 00:47:07.267
I was with Jimmy the whole time.
He can tell you.

00:47:07.267 --> 00:47:08.633
-Rae, Rae, Rae, Rae.

00:47:08.633 --> 00:47:10.767
-I see Victoria.

00:47:10.767 --> 00:47:13.633
-Rae, Rae, Rae, Rae.

00:47:13.633 --> 00:47:17.267
[ All talking at once ]

00:47:17.267 --> 00:47:19.667
-You guys are supposed
to be dead!

00:47:19.667 --> 00:47:22.933
-Look at her face.
-I didn't say anything.

00:47:22.933 --> 00:47:25.833
-Ghosts are just chanting,
"Rae, Rae, Rae."

00:47:25.833 --> 00:47:28.500
-I have a feeling
that it might be Rae.

00:47:28.500 --> 00:47:31.133
-I didn't like
the violent way you...

00:47:31.133 --> 00:47:33.367
-[ Speaks indistinctly ]

00:47:33.367 --> 00:47:35.167
-I'm gonna keep yelling,
"Rae, Rae, Rae."

00:47:35.167 --> 00:47:36.400
That's the whole thing
of the game.

00:47:36.400 --> 00:47:37.800
-I voted.

00:47:37.800 --> 00:47:39.900
-Who's yelling?
-I think Victoria.

00:47:39.900 --> 00:47:41.400
-Wait, was it Rae?
-Why me?

00:47:41.400 --> 00:47:43.067
-Yes, yes.
-Jimmy, you're just salty.

00:47:43.067 --> 00:47:45.800
-My God, you guys vote for --
-What is happening?

00:47:45.800 --> 00:47:48.567
-Sykkuno?! Are you joking?!

00:47:48.567 --> 00:47:50.700
-He's suspicious.
-He's not suspicious.

00:47:50.700 --> 00:47:53.500
He's not suspicious.
He's not suspicious.

00:47:53.500 --> 00:47:56.300
Alright, two imposters remain.

00:47:56.300 --> 00:47:58.133
-It might be Jimmy again.

00:47:58.133 --> 00:47:59.400
-[ Speaks indistinctly ]

00:47:59.400 --> 00:48:01.267
-No, Jimmy.

00:48:01.267 --> 00:48:03.167
Jimmy, you were just accusing me
for no reason.

00:48:03.167 --> 00:48:04.467
-He was.

00:48:04.467 --> 00:48:06.233
-I've seen your acting and
sometimes you like --

00:48:06.233 --> 00:48:07.367
You look around the room like...

00:48:07.367 --> 00:48:08.500
-Guys, I think it's Rae.

00:48:08.500 --> 00:48:13.300
[ All talking at once ]

00:48:13.300 --> 00:48:15.267
-Listen.

00:48:15.267 --> 00:48:17.100
It's not Rae.

00:48:17.100 --> 00:48:18.500
-I'm not gonna stand and hide.

00:48:18.500 --> 00:48:20.633
-10 people said it was Rae.
-It's not.

00:48:20.633 --> 00:48:23.833
Listen, they're trolling.

00:48:23.833 --> 00:48:25.500
-Rae, I can see it
in your glasses reflection.

00:48:25.500 --> 00:48:27.567
[ Laughter ]

00:48:27.567 --> 00:48:29.867
-I just saw Rae vent.
I just saw Rae vent.

00:48:29.867 --> 00:48:32.967
-[ Laughing ]

00:48:32.967 --> 00:48:34.800
[ All talking at once ]

00:48:34.800 --> 00:48:35.967
-We're all just hanging here.

00:48:35.967 --> 00:48:38.433
-Where are you going?
Where are you going?

00:48:38.433 --> 00:48:39.700
-This is the longest I've --

00:48:39.700 --> 00:48:41.200
-Push the button.
-Where you going?

00:48:41.200 --> 00:48:42.467
-I'm gonna push the button.

00:48:42.467 --> 00:48:43.833
-Anyone trying to do
any of the tasks?

00:48:43.833 --> 00:48:44.900
-No. No one.

00:48:44.900 --> 00:48:47.733
Noah, come here.

00:48:47.733 --> 00:48:50.467
Come to this deep, dark corner.

00:48:50.467 --> 00:48:51.500
[ Laughs ]

00:48:51.500 --> 00:48:53.733
-Oh, my God.
-It was Rae.

00:48:53.733 --> 00:48:55.967
-I told you!

00:48:55.967 --> 00:49:00.100
-I've got three of the ghosts
chanting, "Rae, Rae, Rae."

00:49:00.100 --> 00:49:01.633
-Everyone was right.
-[ Laughing ]

00:49:01.633 --> 00:49:06.167
-It's true.
Jimmy did call me out.

00:49:06.167 --> 00:49:07.267
-Oh, my gosh.

00:49:07.267 --> 00:49:09.000
-Like, Rae took a knife

00:49:09.000 --> 00:49:11.933
and decapitated my head off
violently.

00:49:11.933 --> 00:49:14.000
-And then laughed at it.
-Right.

00:49:14.000 --> 00:49:16.300
-Rae brought me to a corner
and killed me.

00:49:16.300 --> 00:49:18.300
-I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
-I only killed one person.

00:49:18.300 --> 00:49:20.200
Rae, thank you
for carrying that.

00:49:20.200 --> 00:49:21.933
I only killed one person.

00:49:21.933 --> 00:49:23.733
-You didn't kill anyone?

00:49:23.733 --> 00:49:26.233
-You know, I killed --
I killed -- Who did I kill?

00:49:26.233 --> 00:49:27.333
I killed one person.

00:49:27.333 --> 00:49:28.533
-Jimmy, what is the charity at?

00:49:28.533 --> 00:49:31.733
-Did you kill Kirk,
Victoria?

00:49:31.733 --> 00:49:34.400
-We're almost hitting
the charity goal.

00:49:34.400 --> 00:49:35.467
-Jimmy, Jimmy,
what is the charity at?

00:49:35.467 --> 00:49:36.967
-What is the charity goal?

00:49:36.967 --> 00:49:38.733
-The charity is Feeding America.

00:49:38.733 --> 00:49:40.000
-No, but I mean,
like, what is it?

00:49:40.000 --> 00:49:42.833
-There's a goal.
It's $25,000.

00:49:42.833 --> 00:49:45.633
-Oh, what is the goal?
It's endless.

00:49:45.633 --> 00:49:47.833
-It's endless, but on
the screen, it says $25,000.

00:49:47.833 --> 00:49:50.267
-Oh, $25,000 is the goal,
by the way.

00:49:50.267 --> 00:49:51.900
-What are we at right now?

00:49:51.900 --> 00:49:53.733
-We're at $17,500,

00:49:53.733 --> 00:49:55.567
and I'm just going
to announce right now

00:49:55.567 --> 00:49:56.900
that I'm gonna take care
of the rest of it

00:49:56.900 --> 00:49:58.733
so we can make our goal.
We have $25,000.

00:49:58.733 --> 00:49:59.967
-Aw, Jimmy.
-That's cool.

00:49:59.967 --> 00:50:01.733
-Thank you guys so much
for doing this.

00:50:01.733 --> 00:50:03.867
-Thank you.
-Thank you for having us on.

00:50:03.867 --> 00:50:04.900
-Awesome.

00:50:04.900 --> 00:50:07.700
Again, my thanks
to Gaten Matarazzo,

00:50:07.700 --> 00:50:09.833
Noah Schnapp, Victoria Tran,

00:50:09.833 --> 00:50:12.233
Tariq Trotter,
Questlove, Kirk Douglas,

00:50:12.233 --> 00:50:15.867
