streamers -- Valkyrae.

00:50:15.867 --> 00:50:18.300
Rae!
-Murderer!

00:50:18.300 --> 00:50:19.800
-Oh, my gosh.

00:50:19.800 --> 00:50:21.667
-She never killed me.
I'll trust you forever.

00:50:21.667 --> 00:50:25.900
And Corpse Husband...
-Thank you.

00:50:25.900 --> 00:50:27.367
